    "about": [
      "A cycle to lyrics by Michalis Bourboulis and the composer (Op. 38, 1977), sung by Stelios Marketakis, with Hadjidakis orchestrating and conducting. A nocturnal Athens: “Stin pyli t' Adrianou”, “Psila stin Akrokorintho”, “Thanatos sti Lachanagora”. He would revise the cycle in 1985."
